        "raw": "<p>Visionary, Haka, The Argent Adept and Setback vs. Kismet in The Block</p><p>Visionary puts Wrest the Mind on Char. &nbsp;When Char attacks, he hits all non-inmate targets for 2 fire and 2 toxic damage. &nbsp;Does Visionary redirect 2 fire and 2 toxic (4 total damage) to a target of choice by dealing herself Char and herself 3 psychic damage each (one instance of damage)?</p><p>OR does Visionary and Char take 3 psychic damage twice for the 2 fire and then the 2 toxic (separate)?</p><p>OR is there 2 toxic and 2 fire per non-inmate target to be redirected individually for 3 damage apiece (either as a set of 4 damage at once or 2 and 2 separately)?</p><p>In addition, if the third option is correct, is it only redirected instances of damage until Char is dead (since things aren&#39;t technically simultaneous) or how would that work?</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">ALSO since Friendly Fire is in play, does each instance of redirected damage allow Visionary to do two damage to Setback plus 2 for each time she does 3 psychic to Char?</span></p>",
