        "raw": "<p>It would be 3B. Char will attempt to perform 2 separate attacks (instances of damage) on each non-inmate target. There will be (non-inmates * 2) total attacks or instances of damage. Each of these attacks can be redirected by Visionary. Each time Visionary redirects the damage, Char will take 3 damage, and the Visionary will take 3 damage. If Char is destroyed before completing all attacks, all additional attacks will be cancelled out. (Side note: If Char dies from Visionary dealing him 3 damage, she will not take 3 damage, since will be destroyed before she can take the damage.)</p><p>With Friendly Fire, Setback can only take the damage and tokens when Visionary deals the 3 psychic damage to Char. Redirected attacks to not change the source of damage, which means that each redirected attack is still being perfomed by Char and not Visionary, so Firendly Fire wouldn&#39;t activate.</p>",
